    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Select locations on your terrain to do your planting or rearing animals.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/058d1e8733725166c6f87a0460160b17.poster.avif?t=1754574017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/058d1e8733725166c6f87a0460160b17.webm?t=1754574017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/058d1e8733725166c6f87a0460160b17.mp4?t=1754574017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Clear the ground of weeds or disease by solving minesweeper puzzles.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/28634a87a5bf26c657ed33645fac389d.poster.avif?t=1754574017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/28634a87a5bf26c657ed33645fac389d.webm?t=1754574017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/28634a87a5bf26c657ed33645fac389d.mp4?t=1754574017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Harvest and sell the produce to earn money to expand your farm.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/b546983f8869d111c6eea62376c30f8f.poster.avif?t=1754574017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/b546983f8869d111c6eea62376c30f8f.webm?t=1754574017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/b546983f8869d111c6eea62376c30f8f.mp4?t=1754574017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use part of your money to improve your farm or buy new lands to expand your business.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/8a2cf8b525888590d6814258c14f57c7.poster.avif?t=1754574017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/8a2cf8b525888590d6814258c14f57c7.webm?t=1754574017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/8a2cf8b525888590d6814258c14f57c7.mp4?t=1754574017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Select locations on your terrain to do your planting or rearing animals.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/058d1e8733725166c6f87a0460160b17.poster.avif?t=1754574017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/058d1e8733725166c6f87a0460160b17.webm?t=1754574017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/058d1e8733725166c6f87a0460160b17.mp4?t=1754574017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Clear the ground of weeds or disease by solving minesweeper puzzles.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/28634a87a5bf26c657ed33645fac389d.poster.avif?t=1754574017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/28634a87a5bf26c657ed33645fac389d.webm?t=1754574017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/28634a87a5bf26c657ed33645fac389d.mp4?t=1754574017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Harvest and sell the produce to earn money to expand your farm.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/b546983f8869d111c6eea62376c30f8f.poster.avif?t=1754574017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/b546983f8869d111c6eea62376c30f8f.webm?t=1754574017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/b546983f8869d111c6eea62376c30f8f.mp4?t=1754574017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use part of your money to improve your farm or buy new lands to expand your business.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/8a2cf8b525888590d6814258c14f57c7.poster.avif?t=1754574017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/8a2cf8b525888590d6814258c14f57c7.webm?t=1754574017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797740/extras/8a2cf8b525888590d6814258c14f57c7.mp4?t=1754574017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
